==English==
===Etymology===
From {{etyl|ru|en}} {{term|у́гры|lang=ru}}, the name of an indigenous people dwelling east of the Urals, {{suffix||ic|lang=en}}.

===Adjective===
{{en-adj|-}}

# Of or pertaining to a group of languages that includes [[Hungarian]], [[Khanty]] and [[Mansi]].

